{"id":"773cae915e5165f3","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-partial-value-conventions.md","title":"73-df-partial-value-conventions — Partial Values and Graph Conventions","display":"73-df-partial-value-conventions — Partial Values and Graph Conventions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-partial-value-conventions","aliases":["73-df-partial-value-conventions"],"display":"73-df-partial-value-conventions — Partial Values and Graph Conventions","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-partial-value-conventions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-partial-value-conventions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"73-df-partial-value-conventions — Partial Values and Graph Conventions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>背景使用集合论及有类型的类缩写；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\">\\(f,g\\)</span> 为候选函数图，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in A\">\\(a\\in A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in B\">\\(b\\in B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本文件定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PFun}\">\\(\\operatorname{PFun}\\)</span>、部分值收敛与 Kleene 相等、以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pmin}\">\\(\\operatorname{pmin}\\)</span>。只有存在图元素时才使用普通点值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(a)\">\\(f(a)\\)</span>；带 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\downarrow,\\uparrow,\\simeq\">\\(\\downarrow,\\uparrow,\\simeq\\)</span> 的式子按下列图公式消去。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}\\)</span>、有限序列及自然数次序为背景集合论运算；同名函数在不同声明类型或固定环境下为独立实例，不跨类型识别。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PFun}\">\\(\\operatorname{PFun}\\)</span> 的定义对候选图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 给出；其后的收敛、发散和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq\">\\(\\simeq\\)</span> 子句使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g:A\\rightharpoonup B\">\\(f,g:A\\rightharpoonup B\\)</span>。点值比较只在相应收敛域内使用；定义部分函数时先给出图，而不把未定义值放在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\coloneqq\">\\(\\coloneqq\\)</span> 的右边。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}value\\text{-}conventions}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PFun}(f,A,B)\\leftrightarrow f\\subseteq A\\times B\\land\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\forall b,c\\in B\\;((a,b)\\in f\\land(a,c)\\in f\\to b=c)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}value\\text{-}conventions}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PFun}(f,A,B)\\leftrightarrow f\\subseteq A\\times B\\land\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\forall b,c\\in B\\;((a,b)\\in f\\land(a,c)\\in f\\to b=c)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}value\\text{-}conventions}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nf:A\\rightharpoonup B&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{PFun}(f,A,B),\\\\\nf(a)\\downarrow=b&amp;\\leftrightarrow(a,b)\\in f,\\\\\nf(a)\\downarrow&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists b\\in B\\;(a,b)\\in f,\\\\\nf(a)\\uparrow&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\exists b\\in B\\;(a,b)\\in f,\\\\\nf(a)\\simeq g(a)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(f(a)\\uparrow\\land g(a)\\uparrow\\bigr)\\lor\n\\exists b\\in B\\;((a,b)\\in f\\land(a,b)\\in g).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}value\\text{-}conventions}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nf:A\\rightharpoonup B&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{PFun}(f,A,B),\\\\\nf(a)\\downarrow=b&amp;\\leftrightarrow(a,b)\\in f,\\\\\nf(a)\\downarrow&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists b\\in B\\;(a,b)\\in f,\\\\\nf(a)\\uparrow&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\exists b\\in B\\;(a,b)\\in f,\\\\\nf(a)\\simeq g(a)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(f(a)\\uparrow\\land g(a)\\uparrow\\bigr)\\lor\n\\exists b\\in B\\;((a,b)\\in f\\land(a,b)\\in g).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}value\\text{-}conventions}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{pmin}\\coloneqq\n\\{(S,m)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\times\\mathbb N:\nm\\in S\\land\\forall n\\in S\\;m\\le n\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{pmin}:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N,\\qquad\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{pmin})=\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\setminus\\{\\emptyset\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}value\\text{-}conventions}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{pmin}\\coloneqq\n\\{(S,m)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\times\\mathbb N:\nm\\in S\\land\\forall n\\in S\\;m\\le n\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{pmin}:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N,\\qquad\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{pmin})=\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\setminus\\{\\emptyset\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>空候选集不被赋予任意最小值；时间、空间和神谕时间的未停机输入保持未定义。该约定不会把部分运行代价改成总函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"f,g","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in B","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PFun}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pmin}","display":false},{"tex":"f(a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\downarrow,\\uparrow,\\simeq","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PFun}","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\simeq","display":false},{"tex":"f,g:A\\rightharpoonup B","display":false},{"tex":"\\coloneqq","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}value\\text{-}conventions}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PFun}(f,A,B)\\leftrightarrow f\\subseteq A\\times B\\land\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\forall b,c\\in B\\;((a,b)\\in f\\land(a,c)\\in f\\to b=c)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}value\\text{-}conventions}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nf:A\\rightharpoonup B&\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{PFun}(f,A,B),\\\\\nf(a)\\downarrow=b&\\leftrightarrow(a,b)\\in f,\\\\\nf(a)\\downarrow&\\leftrightarrow\\exists b\\in B\\;(a,b)\\in f,\\\\\nf(a)\\uparrow&\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\exists b\\in B\\;(a,b)\\in f,\\\\\nf(a)\\simeq g(a)&\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(f(a)\\uparrow\\land g(a)\\uparrow\\bigr)\\lor\n\\exists b\\in B\\;((a,b)\\in f\\land(a,b)\\in g).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}value\\text{-}conventions}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{pmin}\\coloneqq\n\\{(S,m)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\times\\mathbb N:\nm\\in S\\land\\forall n\\in S\\;m\\le n\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{pmin}:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N,\\qquad\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{pmin})=\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\setminus\\{\\emptyset\\}","display":true}],"bytes":2445,"backlinks":[{"id":"1a769cdc24b3e236","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；$s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}$；$\\operatorname{HaltingRun}$ 见 [[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]]，$\\operatorname{pmin}$ 见 [[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]。"},{"id":"8658210215541698","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{pmin}$ 与收敛记号见 [[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]；$\\operatorname{time}_M$ 首先定义为函数图，非停机输入不属于其定义域。"},{"id":"219767ec839d8c84","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\pi_i$ 是从 $1$ 开始编号的有序元组投影；$\\mathbf T=(T_1,\\ldots,T_k)$、$\\mathbf h=(h_1,\\ldots,h_k)$。$f$ 在 $L(f)$ 中是 $\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N$ 的部分函数图；$\\operatorname{PFun}$ 见 [[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]。"},{"id":"e1b6653dcbc23ade","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{pmin}$ 及部分值记号见 [[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]；代价定义在且仅在所列候选集合非空的输入上。"},{"id":"0173e0f8c9568f2f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{pmin}$ 与收敛记号见 [[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]。定义 $\\operatorname{stime}_M$ 时不预设 $M$ 计算任何总函数；该要求仅在 $\\mathsf{FP}$ 的存在量词内出现。"},{"id":"a36ff62aa04d500e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8346a921772e7ddf","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"995085b8741b47ae","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":[]}